The curl patch of curl-impersonate 2.3.2 with two changes: the CMake targets
OpenSSL::SSL and OpenSSL::Crypto made for BoringSSL when it has none (as before), and
an empty value of a QUIC transport parameter of the h3 settings string taken as a
parameter of length zero instead of an error (ec2a2317f14f of lexiforest/curl-
impersonate main, 24.11.2026: "Allow empty settings in h3 settings string"; aZ,
24.11.2026 20:26: «сейчас обновляй»).

